  "nodes": [
    {
      "post_id": "553145859089920000",
      "text": "Response to horrific #CharlieHebdo murders should be to protect civil liberties not limit them. Not an excuse for more mass surveillance.",
      "timestamp": "Thu Jan 08 11:07:04 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": null,
      "post_type": "source"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "553167962283065344",
      "text": "@openrightsgroup @somesheep \ni confess i'm not seeing the logic here. i certainly don't want to limit h.r. but how will that help here?",
      "timestamp": "Thu Jan 08 12:34:54 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.5314585908992e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "553146716091080704",
      "text": "@OpenRightsGroup Also, being anti-religion is not same as being racist. You can't change colour, you can change religion. It's fair game.",
      "timestamp": "Thu Jan 08 11:10:28 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.5314585908992e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "553172916339478530",
      "text": "@RonJeffries I don’t think UK legislation helps, if that’s what you’re asking. I think it’s 100% wrong.",
      "timestamp": "Thu Jan 08 12:54:35 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.531718648396636e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "553171864839663617",
      "text": "@somesheep didn't stop the crime, though. what would help with that aspect?",
      "timestamp": "Thu Jan 08 12:50:24 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.5317043859634586e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "553156008101834752",
      "text": "@OpenRightsGroup @JackofKent The tragedy is that allowing the next attack will bring inevitably the far right to power. Inevitable?",
      "timestamp": "Thu Jan 08 11:47:24 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.5314585908992e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "553146423697752065",
      "text": "@OpenRightsGroup @SamirAllioui Sad that people are using #CharlieHebdo as an excuse to push more surveillance. That's not the answer.",
      "timestamp": "Thu Jan 08 11:09:19 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.5314585908992e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "553169030522368000",
      "text": "@RonJeffries You think increased surveillance is the sensible consequence? (I expect I misunderstand your objection.)",
      "timestamp": "Thu Jan 08 12:39:08 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.5316796228306534e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "553170438596345856",
      "text": "@RonJeffries In the UK, currently, publishing such cartoons is legally considered a “hate crime”. So rights are already curbed.",
      "timestamp": "Thu Jan 08 12:44:44 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.5316930678818406e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "553173989749948416",
      "text": "@RonJeffries This act was not about “revenge” but about intimidation. “We can shut up the few.”",
      "timestamp": "Thu Jan 08 12:58:51 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.531730591719301e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "553169306788184064",
      "text": "@somesheep i do not favor reducing civil liberties but i don't see how protecting them would have prevented this tragedy.",
      "timestamp": "Thu Jan 08 12:40:14 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.53169030522368e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "553169671537852416",
      "text": "@RonJeffries I think the point is more that increased surveillance (as it exists in France) has not protected in this case.",
      "timestamp": "Thu Jan 08 12:41:41 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.5316930678818406e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "554560738816057344",
      "text": "@OpenRightsGroup Stand in solidarity with Paris. Fight for free speech. #JeSuisCharlie #CharlieHebdo http://t.co/L2xWFfllYd",
      "timestamp": "Mon Jan 12 08:49:18 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.5314585908992e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "553173757347778562",
      "text": "@RonJeffries If there are only a few lone voices exercising these freedoms, they make easy and symbolic targets.",
      "timestamp": "Thu Jan 08 12:57:55 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.531730591719301e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "553173059171930113",
      "text": "@somesheep i favor freedom but i don't see how more freedom would reduce the chances of such a thing",
      "timestamp": "Thu Jan 08 12:55:09 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.531729163394785e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "553170158035161088",
      "text": "@RonJeffries My personal view: “I am Spartacus”, i.e. publishing such cartoons everywhere, exercising the freedom =&gt; Too many targets.",
      "timestamp": "Thu Jan 08 12:43:37 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.5316930678818406e+17,
